      "writtenOn": "2024-02-16T13:52:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed about avoiding double negatives but this isn\u0027t one: `UntrustedProp` is what we\u0027re validating (similar to `Vcpufreq` above) while `Forbidden` is the issue with it.\n\nFurthermore, I\u0027d rather avoid making the variants of this enum more generic as I\u0027m planning at some point to rework these functions to fully take advantage of the exact opposite: add one error variant per validation criteria per \"device tree component\" so that all the extra `error!` logging can be unified into a single one and we don\u0027t keep overusing (abusing?) `RebootReason`.",
      "parentUuid": "ef587541_fe7d7d98",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 61,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 61,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "78cfa2d942180a12b4acdecb48dc545b51fb63fe",
